        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 43,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Then spake Azariah the son of Hoshaiah, and Johanan the son of Kareah, and all the proud men, saying unto Jeremiah, Thou speakest falsely: the Lord our God hath not sent thee to say, Go not into Egypt to sojourn there:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 51,
            "text": "Jer. 40:8."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
