        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 43:4",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 43,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "But Johanan the son of Kareah, and all the captains of the forces, took all the remnant of Judah, that were returned from all nations, whither they had been driven, to dwell in the land of Judah;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 43:5",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 43,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Even men, and women, and children, and the king’s daughters, and every person that Nebuzar-adan the captain of the guard had left with Gedaliah the son of Ahikam the son of Shaphan, and Jeremiah the prophet, and Baruch the son of Neriah.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 59,
            "text": "Jer. 41:10."
          },
          {
