      },
      {
        "text": "Then came the word of the Lord unto Jeremiah in Tahpanhes, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 43:8",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 43,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Take great stones in thine hand, and hide them in the clay in the brickkiln, which is at the entry of Pharaoh’s house in Tahpanhes, in the sight of the men of Judah;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 83,
            "end": 85
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 43:9",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 43,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And say unto them, Thus saith the Lord of hosts, the God of Israel; Behold, I will send and take Nebuchadrezzar the king of Babylon, my servant, and will set his throne upon these stones that I have hid; and he shall spread his royal pavilion over them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 97,
            "end": 111,
            "text": "Jer. 21:2 (2, 7); 25:9."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 43:10",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 43,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And when he cometh, he shall smite the land of Egypt, and deliver such as are for death to death; and such as are for captivity to captivity; and such as are for the sword to the sword.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 34,
            "text": "Jer. 44:13; 2 Ne. 9:33."
          }
        ],
